# Profit Statement
| Line Item                || 2024 | 2025 |
| ------------------------ || ---- | ---- |
| Revenue                ||      |      |
| * Product Revenue        || 400  | 450  |
| * Service Revenue        || 200  | 240  |
| Revenue Total            || = @[Revenue."Product Revenue",_] + @[Revenue."Service Revenue",_] | = @[Revenue."Product Revenue",2025] + @[Revenue."Service Revenue",2025] |
| Cost of Sales          ||      |      |
| * Materials              || 250  | 280  |
| * Fulfillment            || 80   | 95   |
| Cost of Sales Total      || = @["Cost of Sales".Materials,_] + @["Cost of Sales".Fulfillment,_] | = @["Cost of Sales".Materials,2025] + @["Cost of Sales".Fulfillment,2025] |
| Gross Profit             || = @["Revenue Total",_] - @["Cost of Sales Total",_] | = @["Revenue Total",2025] - @["Cost of Sales Total",2025] |
| Margin Check             || = @["Gross Profit",_] == 270 | = @["Gross Profit",2025] == 315 |
